2026-09-25, and later Updates will be processed the same way. So the
droplet's `~/codexzig`, `~/codexir` and `~/zigemit` were NOT refreshed at
U62: they are still U61's, and nothing on the droplet is U62. The U62
bundles named below existed only in that container, were built from
