Its copied tail had drifted a THIRD way besides the equality helpers and
method-materialize: it read `wasm-exports` as a list of Text, a shape
upstream's emitter has refused since U59 for one `"|a|b|"` literal. For every
valid declaration it rooted no export, so exported functions were pruned.
Nothing in this repo declares one; upstream's `ir-roots-with-declared` is the
same reading done right, and the harness uses it now.

**A cloud-only quirk, fixed:** the zig road first reported codexzig's pin
UNVERIFIED. The receipt said `3eac167` and `borrowed_pin` wanted 8 to 40 hex
characters. git abbreviates to as few characters as are unique in the
repository, never fewer than 7; a full-history checkout gave 8
(`9fff850c` at U60), a depth-1 clone gives 7. Now 7 to 40.

